<title>GERMANY: Audi details 1996 sales and deliveries.</title>
<headline>Audi details 1996 sales and deliveries.</headline>
<dateline>INGOLSTADT, Germany 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to 1995</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales					  18,800  up 12.8 pct</p>
<p>    Worldwide sales			    492,046 up 9.9 pct</p>
<p>     -- Germany				  217,858 up 6.7 pct</p>
<p>     -- United States			  27,379  up 51.1 pct</p>
<p>     -- West Europe outside Germany	199,013 up 13.6 pct</p>
<p>    Automobile production		    491,501 up 10 pct</p>
<p>    Audi market share in Germany	   6.1 pct vs 6.2 pct</p>
<p>    Investments				  1,400   up 60 pct</p>
<p>    Workforce				    35,215  up 6.7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German luxury carmaker is Audi AG, a unit of Volkswagen AG. Audi, which has not yet released profit figures for the year, provided some of the above figures on January 13.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
